                <div class="form-group full"><label>Common Praises <span class="trust">TRUST BUILDER</span></label><textarea id="commonPraises" placeholder="What do reviewers love about it?&#10;e.g., Battery life is incredible, ANC rivals $200 earbuds">${esc(state.commonPraises)}</textarea><span class="hint-green">Real praise from reviews is more convincing than marketing copy.</span></div>
                <div class="form-group full"><label>Who This Is NOT For <span class="trust">TRUST BUILDER</span></label><input id="whoNotFor" value="${esc(state.whoNotFor)}" placeholder="e.g., Audiophiles wanting wired quality, people with very small ears"><span class="hint-green">Telling viewers who should NOT buy builds more trust than any sales pitch.</span></div>
